      "rating": 5,
      "relative_date": "3 months ago",
      "text": "He is a wonderful doctor, now in his late 80s, who has been serving tirelessly as a skin specialist for more than five decades. Hailing from Chirala town, he continues his noble profession with the same dedication and commitment even at this age. Despite advancing years, he has maintained the admirable practice of visiting his clinic in Chirala every Sunday to attend to his patients.\n\nAs I too belong to Chirala, I first took treatment from him nearly 50 years ago. Since then, whenever any skin-related problem arises, I still prefer to consult him with the same confidence and trust. His experience, humble nature, caring attitude, and devotion to the medical profession have earned him immense respect and affection from generations of patients. Doctors like him are truly rare and inspirational.",
